      "role": "user",
      "content": "Actually, look closer at the section on \"transparency-driven automation.\" There's a memorandum attached to the draft regarding the transition to the 'Algorithmic Oversight Protocol.' It basically outlines a plan to move away from non-deterministic neural models toward a strictly rule-based, deterministic framework for all liquidity interventions to ensure full auditability. \n\nDoes your analysis show how that shift would affect our ability to handle high-volatility events?",
